#: src/index.js:113
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads, and Reddit. Facebook and LinkedIn read the title from the page Open Graph metadata."
msgstr "Используется Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, Threads и Reddit. Facebook и LinkedIn читают заголовок со страницы метаданных Open Graph."

#: src/index.js:114
